# TypeScript Development Rules (TypeScript 5.8)

## What's New in TypeScript 5.7/5.8 (2025)

### TypeScript 5.8 Features
- **Improved Control Flow Analysis**: Better type narrowing in return statements
- **--erasableSyntaxOnly Flag**: Error on non-erasable TypeScript syntax
- **--module node18**: Stable module flag for Node.js 18
- **--libReplacement**: Control lib replacement behavior
- **Performance Optimizations**: Faster builds and watch mode

### TypeScript 5.7 Features
- **Never-Initialized Variable Checks**: Catches uninitialized vars in nested functions
- **ES2024 Support**: Full support for latest ECMAScript features
- **--rewriteRelativeImportExtensions**: Auto-rewrite .ts to .js extensions
- **2.5x Faster Startup**: Improved performance for tsc --version and more

## Core Configuration

### Modern tsconfig.json (TypeScript 5.8)
```json
{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2024",
    "lib": ["ES2024", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "module": "esnext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",

    // TypeScript 5.7+ options
    "rewriteRelativeImportExtensions": true,

    // TypeScript 5.8+ options
    "erasableSyntaxOnly": false,

    // Strict type checking
    "strict": true,
    "noUncheckedIndexedAccess": true,
    "exactOptionalPropertyTypes": true,
    "noPropertyAccessFromIndexSignature": true,

    // Module & imports
    "allowJs": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "verbatimModuleSyntax": true,

    // Emit
    "noEmit": true,
    "incremental": true,
    "jsx": "preserve",

    // Path mapping
    "baseUrl": ".",
    "paths": {
      "@/*": ["./src/*"],
      "@/components/*": ["./src/components/*"],
      "@/lib/*": ["./src/lib/*"],
      "@/types/*": ["./src/types/*"]
    },

    // Advanced
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true,
    "plugins": [{ "name": "next" }]
  },
  "include": ["next-env.d.ts", "**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx", ".next/types/**/*.ts"],
  "exclude": ["node_modules"]
}
```

