## Type Definitions

### API Response Types
```typescript
// Base API response structure
type ApiResponse<T> = {
  data: T
  success: boolean
  message?: string
  error?: string
}

// Paginated response
type PaginatedResponse<T> = ApiResponse<{
  items: T[]
  total: number
  page: number
  limit: number
  hasNext: boolean
  hasPrev: boolean
}>

// Error response
type ErrorResponse = {
  success: false
  error: string
  details?: Record<string, string[]>
}
```

